        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Bank głosów polskich zawiera ponad 150 lektorów rodzimych - aktorów, prezenterów, lektorów dubbingowych. Native speakerzy obcojęzyczni to bank głosów dubbingowych dla projektów eksportowych. Stawki dla native są zwykle ok. 2× wyższe niż dla polskich.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-base m-0">Czy każdy lektor w banku jest dostępny natychmiast?</h3>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0 ml-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Większość - tak. Standardowa realizacja nagrania lektorskiego to 24-48h od akceptacji tekstu i wybranego lektora. Niektórzy najbardziej rozchwytywani lektorzy (np. głosy z reklam telewizyjnych) mogą mieć kolejkę 2-5 dni roboczych.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-base m-0">Czy mogę zamówić casting próbny - demo z moim tekstem?</h3>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0 ml-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Tak. Jeśli chcesz mieć pewność przed pełnym zamówieniem, możemy zarejestrować demo dedykowane Twojemu projektowi - fragment Twojego konkretnego tekstu w wykonaniu wybranego lektora. To pozwala usłyszeć jak głos brzmi w realnym kontekście (reklama, narracja do filmu, audiobook itp.) zanim podejmiesz finalną decyzję. <a href="/kontakt/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Skontaktuj się z nami</a> z opisem projektu i wybranym lektorem - wycenimy indywidualnie.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-base m-0">Czy mogę ściągnąć próbkę wybranego lektora, żeby wysłać ją do klienta?</h3>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0 ml-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Tak. Każda próbka głosu lektorskiego w naszym banku jest dostępna do pobrania jako plik MP3. To wygodne dla agencji reklamowych i domów produkcyjnych - wystarczy wybrać 1-3 propozycje z banku, ściągnąć próbki i przesłać klientowi końcowemu do akceptacji. Po zatwierdzeniu finalnego lektora wracasz do nas i zlecasz pełne nagranie.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-base m-0">Co jeśli żaden głos w banku nie pasuje do mojego projektu?</h3>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0 ml-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Internetowy bank głosów Powitania.pl pokazuje <%= voiceCount %> lektorów aktualnie aktywnych. Jeśli żaden nie pasuje - <a href="/kontakt/" class="text-accent hover:underline">napisz do nas</a> z opisem projektu, postaramy się znaleźć rozwiązanie (np. specyficzne dialekty, dziecięce głosy, niszowe języki). Otwarci jesteśmy na nietypowe zlecenia.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="py-12 bg-stone-100/80 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Nie możesz się zdecydować?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-6">Opisz swój projekt, a pomożemy dobrać idealny głos.</p>
    <a href="/kontakt/" class="inline-block bg-accent hover:bg-accent-light text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-colors">Zapytaj o lektora</a>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-3">lub <a href="/kreator/?start=creator" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium">stwórz tekst w kreatorze</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
(function() {
  var PAGE_SIZE = 20;
  var currentBtn = null;
  var allCards = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.voice-card'));
  var filteredCards = allCards.slice();
  var shownCount = PAGE_SIZE;

  // --- Lazy waveform: rysuj slupki dopiero gdy karta wejdzie w ekran (oszczedza ~4 MB HTML).
  // Algorytm 1:1 z dawnym server-side; viewBox 0 0 150 36. ---
  function buildWavePaths(seed) {
    var WB = 150, baseY = 23, topMax = 21, botMax = 12, barW = 0.55, gap = (1 - barW) / 2;
    function rnd(s, i) { var x = Math.sin(s * 9999 + i * 1.37) * 10000; return x - Math.floor(x); }
    var topD = '', botD = '';
    for (var i = 0; i < WB; i++) {
      var r1 = rnd(seed, i), r2 = rnd(seed, i * 3.13 + 7);
      var env = 0.55 + 0.45 * Math.sin(i * 0.20 + seed * 0.7);
      var amp = Math.min(1, (0.4 * r1 + 0.6 * r2) * env + 0.08);
      var topH = +(2 + amp * (topMax - 2)).toFixed(2);
      var botH = +(Math.min(botMax, topH * 0.5 + 1)).toFixed(2);
      var x = +(i + gap).toFixed(3);
      topD += 'M' + x + ' ' + (baseY - topH).toFixed(2) + 'h' + barW + 'v' + topH + 'h-' + barW + 'z';
      botD += 'M' + x + ' ' + baseY + 'h' + barW + 'v' + botH + 'h-' + barW + 'z';
    }
    return { topD: topD, botD: botD };
  }
  function renderWave(prog) {
    if (!prog || prog.dataset.waveDone) return;
    var seed = parseInt(prog.dataset.waveSeed, 10);
    if (isNaN(seed)) return;
    var w = buildWavePaths(seed);
    var tb = prog.querySelector('.wave-top-base'), bb = prog.querySelector('.wave-bot-base');
    var tp = prog.querySelector('.wave-top-played'), bp = prog.querySelector('.wave-bot-played');
    if (tb) tb.setAttribute('d', w.topD);
    if (bb) bb.setAttribute('d', w.botD);
    if (tp) tp.setAttribute('d', w.topD);
    if (bp) bp.setAttribute('d', w.botD);
    prog.dataset.waveDone = '1';
  }
  (function initLazyWaves() {
    var progs = document.querySelectorAll('.audio-progress[data-wave-seed]');
    if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) { progs.forEach(renderWave); return; } // fallback: rysuj wszystkie
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
      entries.forEach(function (e) { if (e.isIntersecting) { renderWave(e.target); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
    }, { rootMargin: '300px 0px' });
    progs.forEach(function (p) {
      io.observe(p);
      // Bezpiecznik: jesli user tapnie zanim IO zdazy, dorysuj falę natychmiast.
      var box = p.closest('.player-box');
      if (box) box.addEventListener('pointerdown', function () { renderWave(p); }, { once: true, capture: true });
    });
  })();

  // --- Audio player ---
  function resetCurrentBtn() {
    if (!currentBtn) return;
    currentBtn.querySelector('.play-icon').classList.remove('hidden');
    currentBtn.querySelector('.pause-icon').classList.add('hidden');
    var oldRow = currentBtn.closest('.player-box');
    if (oldRow) {
      setWavePlayed(oldRow, 0);
      oldRow.querySelector('.audio-time').textContent = '00:00';
    }
  }

  function getAudioEl() {
    var el = document.getElementById('shared-audio-el');
    if (el) el.remove();
    el = document.createElement('audio');
    el.id = 'shared-audio-el';
    el.preload = 'auto';
    el.style.display = 'none';
    document.body.appendChild(el);

    el.addEventListener('timeupdate', function() {
      if (!currentBtn) return;
      var row = currentBtn.closest('.player-box');
      if (!row) return;
      var pct = (el.currentTime / el.duration) * 100;
      if (isFinite(pct)) setWavePlayed(row, pct);
      row.querySelector('.audio-time').textContent = formatTime(el.currentTime);
    });
    el.addEventListener('loadedmetadata', function() {
      if (!currentBtn) return;
      var row = currentBtn.closest('.player-box');
      if (row) row.querySelector('.audio-duration').textContent = formatTime(el.duration);
    });
    el.addEventListener('ended', function() {
      resetCurrentBtn();
      currentBtn = null;
    });
    return el;
  }

  function initAudioPlayer(btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
      e.stopPropagation();
      var src = this.dataset.audio;
      if (!src) return;
      var playIcon = this.querySelector('.play-icon');
      var pauseIcon = this.querySelector('.pause-icon');
      var existing = document.getElementById('shared-audio-el');

      if (currentBtn === this && existing) {
        if (existing.paused) {
          existing.play();
          playIcon.classList.add('hidden');
          pauseIcon.classList.remove('hidden');
        } else {
          existing.pause();
          playIcon.classList.remove('hidden');
          pauseIcon.classList.add('hidden');
        }
        return;
      }

      if (existing && !existing.paused) existing.pause();
      resetCurrentBtn();
      currentBtn = this;

      var audio = getAudioEl();
      audio.src = src;
      audio.load();
      audio.play().then(function() {
        playIcon.classList.add('hidden');
        pauseIcon.classList.remove('hidden');
      }).catch(function(err) {
        console.error('[audio] play error:', err);
        playIcon.classList.remove('hidden');
        pauseIcon.classList.add('hidden');
      });
      playIcon.classList.add('hidden');
      pauseIcon.classList.remove('hidden');
    });
  }

  // Init players + progress bar seek + card click (raz na kartę)
  allCards.forEach(function(card) {
    // Init ALL play buttons per card (may be 1 or 2)
    card.querySelectorAll('.play-btn').forEach(function(btn) {
      initAudioPlayer(btn);
    });
    // Init stop buttons - reset audio do 0:00 + pauza
    card.querySelectorAll('.stop-btn').forEach(function(stopBtn) {
      stopBtn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
        e.stopPropagation();
        var audio = document.getElementById('shared-audio-el');
        if (!audio) return;
        // Tylko reset jeśli ten card jest aktywny
        var cardPlayBtn = card.querySelector('.play-btn');
        if (currentBtn !== cardPlayBtn) return;
        audio.pause();
        audio.currentTime = 0;
        resetCurrentBtn();
        currentBtn = null;
      });
    });
    // Klik w cały player box → play/pause (seek jeśli na progress bar)
    card.querySelectorAll('.player-box').forEach(function(playerBox) {
      playerBox.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
        e.stopPropagation();
        var btn = playerBox.querySelector('.play-btn');
        if (!btn) return;
        // Klik na progress bar → seek
        var prog = e.target.closest('.audio-progress');
        if (prog) {
          var audio = document.getElementById('shared-audio-el');
          if (audio && currentBtn === btn && audio.duration) {
            var rect = prog.getBoundingClientRect();
            var pct = (e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width;
            audio.currentTime = pct * audio.duration;
          }
          return;
        }
        // Klik gdziekolwiek indziej w playerze → toggle play
        if (!e.target.closest('.play-btn')) {
          btn.click();
        }
      });
    });
    // Nawigacja do profilu przez <a> na zdjęciu i nazwisku - brak JS click handler
  });

  // Odslania zagrana (akcentowa) warstwe fali od lewej: pct 0-100.
  function setWavePlayed(row, pct) {
    if (!row) return;
    var wp = row.querySelector('.wave-played');
    if (wp) wp.style.clipPath = 'inset(0 ' + (100 - Math.max(0, Math.min(100, pct))) + '% 0 0)';
  }

  function formatTime(s) {
    var m = Math.floor(s / 60);
    var sec = Math.floor(s % 60);
    return (m < 10 ? '0' : '') + m + ':' + (sec < 10 ? '0' : '') + sec;
  }

  // --- Pagination ---
  function updateVisibility() {
    var visibleCount = 0;
    filteredCards.forEach(function(card, i) {
      if (i < shownCount) {
        card.classList.remove('hidden');
        visibleCount++;
      } else {
        card.classList.add('hidden');
      }
    });

    // Hide cards not in filtered set
    allCards.forEach(function(card) {
      if (filteredCards.indexOf(card) === -1) {
        card.classList.add('hidden');
      }
    });

    var totalFiltered = filteredCards.length;
    document.getElementById('voice-count').textContent = totalFiltered;
    document.getElementById('shown-count').textContent = Math.min(shownCount, totalFiltered);
    document.getElementById('total-filtered').textContent = totalFiltered;

    var loadMoreWrap = document.getElementById('load-more-wrap');
    var noResults = document.getElementById('no-results');

    if (totalFiltered === 0) {
      loadMoreWrap.classList.add('hidden');
      noResults.classList.remove('hidden');
    } else {
      noResults.classList.add('hidden');
      if (shownCount >= totalFiltered) {
        loadMoreWrap.classList.add('hidden');
      } else {
        loadMoreWrap.classList.remove('hidden');
      }
    }
  }

  document.getElementById('load-more-btn').addEventListener('click', function() {
    shownCount += PAGE_SIZE;
    updateVisibility();
  });

  // --- Kreator mode ---
  var kreatorMode = false;
  var kreatorLangs = [];  // Polish-name languages to filter by (e.g. ['angielski'])
  var LANG_MAP = { pl: 'polski', en: 'angielski', de: 'niemiecki', fr: 'francuski', cs: 'czeski', uk: 'ukraiński' };

  // --- Filters ---
  var activeGender = 'all';
  var ivrMode = false;
  var customVoiceIds = []; // Uporządkowana lista ID gdy wchodzimy z linku ?voices=id1,id2,...

  document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn').forEach(function(btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
      // Toggle off: re-klik aktywnego gender pila wraca do "wszyscy".
      // Potrzebne na mobile gdzie nie ma jawnego przycisku "Wszyscy" (oszczedzilismy wiersz).
      if (this.classList.contains('active') && this.dataset.filter === 'gender' && this.dataset.value !== 'all') {
        this.classList.remove('active');
        activeGender = 'all';
        var sel = document.getElementById('filter-gender-select');
        if (sel) sel.value = 'all';
        applyFilters();
        return;
      }
      this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn').forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
      this.classList.add('active');
      activeGender = this.dataset.value;
      applyFilters();
    });
  });

  document.getElementById('filter-lang').addEventListener('change', applyFilters);
  document.getElementById('filter-age').addEventListener('change', applyFilters);
  document.getElementById('filter-price').addEventListener('change', applyFilters);
  document.getElementById('filter-famous').addEventListener('change', applyFilters);
  document.getElementById('filter-native').addEventListener('change', applyFilters);
  document.getElementById('filter-search').addEventListener('input', applyFilters);

  function applyFilters() {
    var lang = document.getElementById('filter-lang').value;
    var age = document.getElementById('filter-age').value;
    var price = document.getElementById('filter-price').value;
    var famous = document.getElementById('filter-famous').checked;
    var native_ = document.getElementById('filter-native').checked;
    var search = document.getElementById('filter-search').value.toLowerCase();

    filteredCards = allCards.filter(function(card) {
      if (customVoiceIds.length > 0 && customVoiceIds.indexOf(card.dataset.id) === -1) return false;
      if (activeGender !== 'all' && card.dataset.gender !== activeGender) return false;
      if ((kreatorMode || ivrMode) && card.dataset.hideprice === 'true') return false;
      if (kreatorMode && kreatorLangs.length > 0) {
        var cardLangs = card.dataset.languages;
        var hasAny = kreatorLangs.some(function(kl) { return cardLangs.indexOf(kl) !== -1; });
        if (!hasAny) return false;
      }
      if (lang !== 'all' && card.dataset.languages.indexOf(lang) === -1) return false;
      if (age !== 'all') {
        var cardAge = card.dataset.age;
        if (age === '50+') {
          if (cardAge !== '50 lat +' && cardAge !== '50+') return false;
        } else if (age === '20-30') {
          if (cardAge !== '20-30 lat' && cardAge !== '20-30') return false;
        } else if (age === '30-50') {
          if (cardAge !== '30-50 lat' && cardAge !== '30-50') return false;
        }
      }
      if (price !== 'all' && card.dataset.price !== price) return false;
      if (famous && card.dataset.famous !== 'true') return false;
      if (native_ && card.dataset.native !== 'true') return false;
      if (search && card.dataset.name.indexOf(search) === -1) return false;
      return true;
    });

    // Niestandardowa kolejność z URL (?voices=id1,id2,...) - sortuj + przenieś w DOM
    if (customVoiceIds.length > 0) {
      filteredCards.sort(function(a, b) {
        return customVoiceIds.indexOf(a.dataset.id) - customVoiceIds.indexOf(b.dataset.id);
      });
      var grid = document.getElementById('voices-grid');
      if (grid) {
        filteredCards.forEach(function(card) { grid.appendChild(card); });
      }
    }

    shownCount = PAGE_SIZE;
    updateVisibility();
    updateFilterHighlights();
    // Jeśli siatka lektorów zjechała powyżej viewportu (strona skróciła się po filtrze),
    // przewiń do jej początku żeby nie lądować na stopce/treściach SEO
    var grid = document.getElementById('voices-grid');
    if (grid && grid.getBoundingClientRect().top < 0) {
      window.scrollTo(0, window.scrollY + grid.getBoundingClientRect().top - 80);
    }
  }

  function updateFilterHighlights() {
    // Grupa płci - zielona ramka gdy nie "Wszyscy"
    var genderGroup = document.getElementById('gender-group');
    if (genderGroup) {
      if (activeGender !== 'all') {
        genderGroup.style.borderColor = '#10b981';
      } else {
        genderGroup.style.borderColor = '';
      }
    }
    // Selecty - klasa active gdy wartość ≠ domyślna
    ['filter-gender-select', 'filter-lang', 'filter-age', 'filter-price'].forEach(function(id) {
      var el = document.getElementById(id);
      if (el.value !== 'all') {
        el.classList.add('active');
      } else {
        el.classList.remove('active');
      }
    });
    // Szukajka - zielona ramka gdy coś wpisano
    var searchEl = document.getElementById('filter-search');
    if (searchEl.value.length > 0) {
      searchEl.style.borderColor = '#10b981';
    } else {
      searchEl.style.borderColor = '';
    }
  }

  window.resetFilters = function() {
    activeGender = 'all';
    kreatorMode = false;
    kreatorLangs = [];
    ivrMode = false;
    // Jeśli była niestandardowa lista - wyczyść ją i przywróć pierwotny porządek DOM
    if (customVoiceIds.length > 0) {
      customVoiceIds = [];
      var grid = document.getElementById('voices-grid');
      if (grid) {
        allCards.forEach(function(card) { grid.appendChild(card); });
      }
    }
    document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn').forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
    document.querySelector('.filter-btn[data-value="all"]').classList.add('active');
    var genderSel = document.getElementById('filter-gender-select');
    if (genderSel) genderSel.value = 'all';
    document.getElementById('filter-lang').value = 'all';
    document.getElementById('filter-age').value = 'all';
    document.getElementById('filter-price').value = 'all';
    document.getElementById('filter-famous').checked = false;
    document.getElementById('filter-native').checked = false;
    document.getElementById('filter-search').value = '';
    document.querySelectorAll('.bank-filter-toggle').forEach(function(p) { p.classList.remove('active'); });
    // Hide kreator banner if visible
    var banner = document.getElementById('kreator-context-banner');
    if (banner) banner.classList.add('hidden');
    applyFilters();
  };

  // Gender select
  window.setGenderFilter = function(val) {
    activeGender = val;
    document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn[data-filter="gender"]').forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
    document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn[data-value="' + val + '"]').forEach(function(b) { b.classList.add('active'); });
    applyFilters();
  };

  // Pill toggle (zamiennik checkboxów)
  window.toggleFilterPill = function(btn, checkboxId) {
    var cb = document.getElementById(checkboxId);
    cb.checked = !cb.checked;
    btn.classList.toggle('active', cb.checked);
    applyFilters();
  };

  // Init: apply URL params as filters (e.g. ?gender=m&native=1&famous=1)
  (function applyUrlFilters() {
    var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
    var g = params.get('gender');
    if (g === 'm' || g === 'f') {
      activeGender = g;
      document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn').forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
      document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn[data-value="' + g + '"]').forEach(function(b) { b.classList.add('active'); });
      var gSel = document.getElementById('filter-gender-select');
      if (gSel) gSel.value = g;
    }
    if (params.get('native') === '1') {
      document.getElementById('filter-native').checked = true;
      var nb = document.getElementById('filter-native-btn');
      if (nb) nb.classList.add('active');
    }
    if (params.get('famous') === '1') {
      document.getElementById('filter-famous').checked = true;
      var fb = document.getElementById('filter-famous-btn');
      if (fb) fb.classList.add('active');
    }
    var lang = params.get('lang');
    if (lang) {
      document.getElementById('filter-lang').value = lang;
    }
    if (params.get('filter') === 'ivr') {
      ivrMode = true;
    }
    // Niestandardowa uporządkowana lista lektorów: ?voices=id1,id2,id3
    var voicesParam = params.get('voices');
    if (voicesParam) {
      customVoiceIds = voicesParam.split(',').map(function(s) { return s.trim(); }).filter(Boolean);
      if (customVoiceIds.length > 0) {
        // Wymuś przebudowę filtrów zaraz po załadowaniu
        setTimeout(applyFilters, 0);
      }
    }
    // Sitelinks search box (Google SearchAction): ?search=<query> ustawia filter-search
    var searchParam = params.get('search') || params.get('q');
    if (searchParam) {
      var searchEl = document.getElementById('filter-search');
      if (searchEl) {
        searchEl.value = searchParam;
        setTimeout(applyFilters, 0);
      }
    }
  })();

  // Kreator context detection + auto-filtering
  (function() {
    try {
      var ctxStr = sessionStorage.getItem('kreatorContext');
      if (!ctxStr) return;
      var ctx = JSON.parse(ctxStr);
      if (!ctx.text) return;

      // Show text preview banner
      var banner = document.getElementById('kreator-context-banner');
      var preview = document.getElementById('context-text-preview');
      if (banner && preview) {
        preview.textContent = ctx.text;
        banner.classList.remove('hidden');
      }

      // Activate kreator mode - hides hidePrice voices
      kreatorMode = true;

      // (Wyceń CTA jest zawsze widoczne na karcie i prowadzi do profilu, gdzie wizard auto-aktywuje się z kontekstu kreatora.)

      // Auto-filter by language based on kreator context
      var langs = ctx.languages || [];
      var foreignLangs = langs.filter(function(l) { return l !== 'pl'; });
      if (foreignLangs.length > 0) {
        // Foreign or bilingual text - show only lectors speaking those languages
        kreatorLangs = foreignLangs.map(function(code) { return LANG_MAP[code]; }).filter(Boolean);
        // Also set dropdown for UI feedback (single language)
        if (kreatorLangs.length === 1) {
          document.getElementById('filter-lang').value = kreatorLangs[0];
        }
      } else {
        // Polish-only text (or no language info) - show only Polish-speaking lectors
        kreatorLangs = ['polski'];
        document.getElementById('filter-lang').value = 'polski';
      }
    } catch(e) {}
  })();

  // Global: clear kreator context and restore full list
  window.clearKreatorContext = function() {
    try { sessionStorage.removeItem('kreatorContext'); } catch(e) {}
    kreatorMode = false;
    kreatorLangs = [];
    var banner = document.getElementById('kreator-context-banner');
    if (banner) banner.classList.add('hidden');
    document.getElementById('filter-lang').value = 'all';
    applyFilters();
  };

  // Expose applyFilters globally for mobile filter elements
  window.applyFiltersGlobal = applyFilters;

  // Toggle "Więcej filtrów" panel on mobile
  window.toggleMoreFilters = function() {
    var panel = document.getElementById('more-filters-panel');
    var arrow = document.getElementById('more-filters-arrow');
    var btn = document.getElementById('more-filters-btn');
    if (panel.classList.contains('hidden')) {
      panel.classList.remove('hidden');
      arrow.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';
      btn.classList.add('active');
    } else {
      panel.classList.add('hidden');
      arrow.style.transform = '';
      btn.classList.remove('active');
    }
  };

  // Sync mobile filters ← desktop on resetFilters
  var origReset = window.resetFilters;
  window.resetFilters = function() {
    origReset();
    // origReset activates first .filter-btn[data-value="all"] found (po usunieciu
    // pila "Wszyscy" z mobile baru: ukryty button w #gender-group). Dla pewnosci
    // dodatkowo aktywujemy state-holder w sidebarze - tu jawnie i czytelnie.
    var sbAll = document.querySelector('#filters-sidebar .filter-btn[data-value="all"]');
    if (sbAll) sbAll.classList.add('active');
    // Reset mobile selects
    var langMob = document.getElementById('filter-lang-mobile');
    var ageMob = document.getElementById('filter-age-mobile');
    var priceMob = document.getElementById('filter-price-mobile');
    var searchMob = document.getElementById('filter-search-mobile');
    var famousMob = document.getElementById('filter-famous-btn-mobile');
    var nativeMob = document.getElementById('filter-native-btn-mobile');
    if (langMob) langMob.value = 'all';
    if (ageMob) ageMob.value = 'all';
    if (priceMob) priceMob.value = 'all';
    if (searchMob) searchMob.value = '';
    if (famousMob) famousMob.classList.remove('active');
    if (nativeMob) nativeMob.classList.remove('active');
    // Close the panel
    var panel = document.getElementById('more-filters-panel');
    var arrow = document.getElementById('more-filters-arrow');
    var moreBtn = document.getElementById('more-filters-btn');
    if (panel) panel.classList.add('hidden');
    if (arrow) arrow.style.transform = '';
    if (moreBtn) moreBtn.classList.remove('active');
  };

  applyFilters();
})();
</script>

